{"status":"completed","summary":"Inventory web applications are running persistently on node2 and node3 at port 8080. Node1 provides persistent round-robin HTTP load balancing on port 80. All three nodes were restarted individually and recovered with changed boot identities; final requests alternated evenly between both backends.","actions_performed":["Created and enabled inventory-web.service on node2 and node3.","Created and enabled inventory-lb.service on node1.","Verified backend health, inventory data, listeners, and round-robin distribution.","Restarted node1, node2, and node3 sequentially and verified post-restart recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Inventory application on node2:8080","command_ids":["cmd-1cd8409aa4a5428b","cmd-7b122de0602f41c7","cmd-0e43dc70e53b4344"],"summary":"Service is enabled and active; port 8080 serves node2 health and inventory data, including after restart."},{"requirement":"Inventory application on node3:8080","command_ids":["cmd-20637be187ee4e12","cmd-1e8c87b620ee4426","cmd-fd7b854cd5e84ed3"],"summary":"Service is enabled and active; port 8080 serves node3 health and inventory data, including after restart."},{"requirement":"Node1 load balancing on port 80","command_ids":["cmd-54dd7aada7fd4c38","cmd-efff123365a54ea4","cmd-497afcd83fdd4ba3"],"summary":"Port 80 is active and enabled; eight final requests alternated node2/node3, and the root page and inventory API succeeded."},{"requirement":"Node1 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-efff123365a54ea4","cmd-acdaaa773f674607","cmd-c9c9a4228c3c4657"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot ID, recovered listener, and balanced post-restart traffic."},{"requirement":"Node2 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-c14e37af26ee41d8","cmd-0e43dc70e53b4344","cmd-497afcd83fdd4ba3"],"summary":"Captured healthy data and reboot acknowledgement, then proved changed boot ID, service recovery, intact inventory, and restored traffic rotation."},{"requirement":"Node3 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-55ab3c6cec5c4bf1","cmd-28f7874fad954545","cmd-fd7b854cd5e84ed3","cmd-497afcd83fdd4ba3"],"summary":"Captured healthy data and reboot acknowledgement, observed the reboot outage, then proved changed boot ID, service recovery, intact inventory, and restored traffic rotation."}]}
